Plan Cache  inside SQL Server Database Engine  

when you run quey: 
SELECT * FROM Employees WHERE EmployeeID = 10;

Query
  ↓
Parse
  ↓
Compile / Optimize
  ↓
Execution Plan
  ↓
Plan Cache
  ↓
Execute


Execution Plan stores in Plan Cache

SQL Server Memory
        │
        ├── Buffer Pool
        │
        ├── Plan Cache
        │       │
        │       ├── Plan 1
        │       ├── Plan 2
        │       ├── Plan 3
        │       └── ...
        │
        └── Other memory

--if you want to remove cached execution plans  from plan cache.  
DBCC FREEPROCCACHE;
